name=ViewpointMac - 3D / first person on macOS (experimental)
id=ViewpointMac
modversion=2.2.0
description=Experimental macOS/Apple Silicon 3D groundwork for Build 42: a Java render hook on zombie.core.SpriteRenderer#postRender, an in-game OpenGL capability probe (writes Zomboid/viewpointmac-report.txt) and a toggleable OpenGL overlay proving custom drawing can be injected into the game frame. The vanilla rendering is never skipped. Single hotkey: Ctrl+Alt+D opens the ViewpointMac control panel, where every feature can be toggled at runtime (function keys are avoided because macOS reserves F9-F12). Requires ZombieBuddy (Java mod loader).
poster=poster.png
